message: "Research prototype and preprint draft; consult the claim boundaries before citing."
title: "Authenticated Name-Channel Noninterference in Frozen Language-Model Scoring"
authors:
  - family-names: Mansour
    given-names: Adel
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
type: software
url: "https://github.com/adelmansourjr/racial-bias-ai-calibration"
abstract: >-
  A scoped typed-identity information-flow prototype with authenticated review
  records, scalarwise segmentation-independent tokenization, model-internal
  activation exclusion, solver-checked abstract lemmas and GPU conformance tests.
  It does not prove universal name discovery or racial fairness in unannotated CVs.
